msgid "YouTube playback cache folder (blank = default, next to your data):"
msgstr ""
"Mapp för YouTube-uppspelningscache (tomt = standard, bredvid din data):"

#: gui/dialogs.py:1476
msgid "Clear cache now"
msgstr "Rensa cache nu"

